{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04384","headline":"感遇诗三十八首 十 · 陈子昂","name":"感遇诗三十八首 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"深居观元化，悱然争朵颐。\n谗说相啖食，利害纷㘈㘈。\n便便夸毘子，荣耀更相持。\n务光让天下，商贾竞刀锥。\n已矣行采芝，万世同一时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04384.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04384","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}